do you want to do with your life?” and I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:07.200
was like “Well X, I think I’m doing it.&nbsp;
I’m making movies.” X goes “No, no, no,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.720
no…but what do you want to do with your career?”

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.120
Film Courage:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:16.720
In terms of getting producers on board, now being&nbsp;
an action filmmaker, how hard was that how easy?

