and so what I did is I was working within the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:35.360
action realm as like a producer of one of like&nbsp;
30 producers on a film or whatever like I was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:43.120
but I was on set and I was working with producers&nbsp;
and then what happened was I then slotted in for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:48.240
like a lower budget action movie for the first&nbsp;
one that I did that was the one I did with DMX&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:54.800
and Johnny Messner Beyond The Law Steven Seagal&nbsp;
and that one was my first action movie and I was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:01.040
able to use the action sequences of that to show&nbsp;
that I could do action so that was like my first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:07.040
attempt at action and what I did is I cut together&nbsp;
an action reel which was just like the action&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:11.840
sequences from that as well as like some action&nbsp;
sequences from the horror movies that I had done&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:17.600
before because if you take each horror movie I do&nbsp;
there's maybe like somebody gets into like a fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:22.240
in each thing like there's little pieces where&nbsp;
there's some things that are action based you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:27.920
cut that all together and then I'm like hey look I&nbsp;
can do action so I didn't really get much pushback&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.640
people believed that I could do it based on like&nbsp;
showing that but I was I was blessed to be able&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:39.440
to have that first opportunity to do an action&nbsp;
movie and that was just because I slotted in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:43.440
with the company after producing a few movies for&nbsp;
them like they're like hey who's going to direct&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:48.720
this action movie can you do it and I was like oh&nbsp;
great and then from there I used that to to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:55.040
action work how do you feel about being an action&nbsp;
director at this stage in your career I love it&nbsp;&nbsp;

